      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61665e3e7448d57ed9eb49da|full_name} ReShade has two versions, a full version and a limited multiplayer safe version. The limited version disables add-ons entirely and has a small selection of curated shaders which ensures players can't get any game advantage with it. This is the version that was previously whitelisted by EAC.",
