  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "About two weeks ago, ReShade was silently blocked by EAC, and it no longer works with VRChat. I've used ReShade for a long time in VR games to add post-processing anti-aliasing, which is much cheaper than MSAA, and to add dithering to reduce color banding. I know others use it to sharpen the screen and improve clarity as well with shaders like VRToolkit.\n\nPlease consider whitelisting the limited version of ReShade.",
